<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria sees 96 oper prof above 5 bln ats.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria sees 96 oper prof above 5 bln ats.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's biggest bank Bank Austria said on Friday group operating profit would exceed five billion schillings this year.</p>
<p>In 1995 the bank posted an operating result of 5.338 billion schillings.</p>
<p>&quot;(Our operating result) will be at least five billion,&quot; chief executive Gerhard Randa told Reuters during an investment fair.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
